/ActualText (My biggest regret is that I was not able to include age as a feature when constructing the decision tree. there is no proper analysis environment in C++. So I couldn't analyze the specifics of age. When I added age as a feature to the decision tree, there were many subsets that did not have data to make predictions based on age, resulting in bugs in the predictions. I've spent a lot of time debugging. but it's still not working. so I had to remove it from the construction of the decision tree.)
